26-9b79-ac16f488d9ce'}, {'abstract': 'Nestled by two rivers and abounding in natural beauty, this Westchester County village has attracted poets, actors and Communists over the years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/03/realestate/croton-on-hudson-ny-a-magnet-for-the-eclectic.html', 'snippet': 'Nestled by two rivers and abounding in natural beauty, this Westchester County village has attracted poets, actors and Communists over the years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A chance encounter at Grand Central Terminal led Laura Beckwith and her partner, Walter DeVoe Yates III, to Croton-on-Hudson. Rushing for her train to Hastings-on-Hudson, where she and Mr. Yates had been renting a house and where they had been searching unsuccessfully for a home to buy, Ms. Beckwith spotted a friend. When she groaned in response to a question about her house-hunting progress, her friend replied: “Croton! I grew up there. Look it up!”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/realestate/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/07/realestate/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/realestate/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/realestate/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG/07LIVING-CROTON-slide-44VG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's