17/05/03/arts/dance/koma-otakes-ghost-festival-means-to-summon-spirits.html', 'snippet': 'The Japanese dancer, half of a duo with his wife Eiko, will return to St. Mark’s Church to expand an otherworldly piece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a winter evening in the East Village last year, the dancer Koma Otake lured an audience outdoors for a hurricane of a performance on the steps of St. Mark’s Church. The cold was unforgiving, but no one seemed to mind, as he shuffled through sand in pink satin shoes, climbed a fence and shrieked into the night, the eye of his own storm.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/arts/07GUIDE7/07G