'_id': 'nyt://article/62ad9b56-fafd-54e2-b2e2-3ac258dd3a25', 'word_count': 1162, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62ad9b56-fafd-54e2-b2e2-3ac258dd3a25'}, {'abstract': 'In his first address laying out his vision as secretary of state, Rex W. Tillerson said that the United States had done too much for allies and emerging nations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/03/us/rex-tillerson-state-department.html', 'snippet': 'In his first address laying out his vision as secretary of state, Rex W. Tillerson said that the United States had done too much for allies and emerging nations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In his first address laying out his vision as secretary of state, Rex W. Tillerson said Wednesday that the United States had been far too accommodating to emerging nations and longtime allies and that “things have gotten out of balance.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04tillerson1/04tillerson1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04tillerson1/04tillerson1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04tillerson1/04tillerson1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04tillerson1/04tillerson1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04tillerson1/04tillerson1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su