arçons exclusives at the Met, Nick Jonas at Bloomingdale’s, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': ' On Thursday, the online vintage retailer Spark Pretty will open a ’90s Forever Summer Break Edition pop-up with one-of-a-kind hand-painted and Swarovski crystal-studded denim jackets by Tony Alamo, including “Barbie at the Beach” ($850), mix-and-match neon bikini sets ($35) and novelty tees ($25). At 333 East Ninth Street.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 740}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 831, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1661, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/fashion/04scout1/04scout1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin