yt://article/dbfca0a6-a706-56af-b1f9-2c700f2e10b9'}, {'abstract': 'Several administration officials said the president would mark the National Day of Prayer on Thursday by issuing an executive order easing the risk of religious groups losing their tax-exempt status.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/03/us/politics/trump-religion-executive-order-gay-rights.html', 'snippet': 'Several administration officials said the president would mark the National Day of Prayer on Thursday by issuing an executive order easing the risk of religious groups losing their tax-exempt status.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump on Thursday will ease restrictions on political activity by tax-exempt churches and charities, White House officials said, but has backed away from a broader religious liberty order that would have allowed faith-based organizations and companies to avoid serving or hiring gay people.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04religion-sub/04religion-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04religion-sub/04religion-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04religion-sub/04religion-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04religion-sub/04religion-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/