'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By HAEYOUN PARK, MARGOT SANGER-KATZ and JASMINE C. LEE', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Haeyoun', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'PARK', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Margot', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'SANGER-KATZ', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Jasmine', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'LEE', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/4114c916-b519-5b9a-acd4-49052c13b919', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/4114c916-b519-5b9a-acd4-49052c13b919'}, {'abstract': 'The largest owner of local TV stations, Sinclair has a history of supporting Republican causes. But as Sinclair tries to grow, it is locking horns with Fox.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/03/business/dealbook/sinclair-media-expansion-fox-conservative-media.html', 'snippet': 'The largest owner of local TV stations, Sinclair has a history of supporting Republican causes. But as Sinclair tries to grow, it is locking horns with Fox.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The timing could not be more fortunate for Sinclair Broadcast Group: a Republican president is in the White House, his regulators have just eased rules on owning television stations and the dominant name in conservative media is reeling from a sexual harassment scandal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fox’s Unfamiliar but Powerful Television Rival: Sinclair', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Broadcaster Sets a Collision Course With Fox', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '21st Century Fox', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sinclair Broadcast Group Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tribune Media Company', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-03T22:53:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced and Nicholas Fandos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fandos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ace52ee8-f03b-5457-a248-18b8fede1717', 'word_count': 1496, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ace52ee8-f03b-5457-a248-18b8fede1717'}, {'abstract': 'Colonel Thorsness received the Medal of Honor. After his plane was shot down, he was brutalized for years at the notorious prison known as the Hanoi Hilton.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/03/us/obituary-leo-thorsness-dead-vietnam-medal-of-honor.html', 'snippet': 'Colonel Thorsness received the Medal of Honor. After his plane was shot down, he was brutalized for years at the notorious prison known as the Hanoi Hilton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Col. Leo K. Thorsness, one of the most highly decorated American airmen of the Vietnam War and a belated recipient of the Medal of Honor for his heroism on a mission that took place 11 days before he was shot down and taken prisoner, died on Tuesday in Jacksonville, Fla. Colonel Thorsness, who had been brutalized during his six years of captivity at the notorious North Vietnamese prison known as the Hanoi Hilton, where he was a cellmate of John McCain’s, was 85.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 489, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 489}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1668, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/us/04thorsness-obit-1/04thorsness-obit-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leo Thorsness, Decorated Veteran Held Captive With McCain, Dies at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he