ted cubes of manchego cheese and a pile of anchovies marinated in a peppery olive oil. Another drink and, an hour later, we were onto meaty rings of fried calamari and hunks of crispy dogfish.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/travel/07HEADSUP1/07HEADSUP1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Granada, Spain, the Tapas Bar Scene Gets Fresh Life', 'kicker': 'Heads Up', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Toast to More Tapas … on the House', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': No