America’s busiest train station.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The news out of Pennsylvania Station lately has been very, very bad. A train derails, taking out some switches, shutting tracks and snarling travel for days. A power line fails and service stops again, sending thousands of riders shuttling between rage and despair. A rumor of gunshots sets off a panic among waiting passengers, who run through the station like spooked cattle.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 601}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1923, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/opinion/04thu1/04thu1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Let Pe