 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 320}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1094, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05RISK/05RISK-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Revisiting the Mystery of Julian Assange, in ‘Risk’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Intimate Portrait, With Blurred Lines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Risk (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poitras, Laura', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assange, Julian P', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WikiLeaks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-04T20:20:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/707c9ef3-d953-5b2c-8c46-e73e4031a2fb', 'word_count': 910, 'uri': 'nyt://article/707c9ef3-d953-5b2c-8c46-e73e4031a2fb'}, {'abstract': 'The deaths of the refugees found in a locked truck parked on an Austrian highway two summers ago cast a spotlight on Europe’s response to the migrant crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/04/world/europe/hungary-indicts-11-in-truck-suffocation-of-71-refugees.html', 'snippet': 'The deaths of the refugees found in a locked truck parked on an Austrian highway two summers ago cast a spotlight on Europe’s response to the migrant crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Hungary indicted 11 people suspected of being smugglers on Thursday in the suffocation of 71 refugees, whose decomposing bodies were found stuffed inside a locked truck parked in neighboring Austria two summers ago at the height of Europe’s migration crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/world/05hungary/05hungary-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/05/world/05hungary/05hungary-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt