 'nyt://article/0404e2e6-9854-55d3-95d1-6d1534186e01'}, {'abstract': 'The arrest in the rape of an 11-year-old girl in Upper Manhattan was the latest product of an effort by Cyrus R. Vance Jr., the Manhattan district attorney, to focus on testing backlogged rape kits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/04/nyregion/dna-arrest-1993-rape-case-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'The arrest in the rape of an 11-year-old girl in Upper Manhattan was the latest product of an effort by Cyrus R. Vance Jr., the Manhattan district attorney, to focus on testing backlogged rape kits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was one of those ugly, unsolved crimes that seem to haunt many neighborhoods in New York City: In February 1993, a man with a knife abducted an 11-year-old girl in an apartment building hallway in the Hamilton Heights section of Manhattan, forced her to the roof and sexually assaulted her.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '24 Years Later, DNA Leads to Arrest in Manhattan Attack on a Girl', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '24 Years Later, DNA Leads To Arrest in Attack on Girl', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forensic Science', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vance, Cyrus R Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hamilton Heights (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-05T00:28:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlen