abstract': 'This NBC comedy served up a season ender that left the store in ruins. It was a case of capitalizing on some real-life dislocation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/04/arts/television/the-superstore-season-2-finale-a-disaster-on-purpose.html', 'snippet': 'This NBC comedy served up a season ender that left the store in ruins. It was a case of capitalizing on some real-life dislocation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Disruption can sometimes be turned into opportunity, and Thursday night’s clamorous Season 2 finale of “Superstore” proved it. The show, a well-written NBC comedy full of exceedingly likable characters, is set in a Walmart-like retail outlet, and by the episode’s end, the store was in ruins, having been leveled by a tornado.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/04/arts/05superstore/05superstore-thum