ichael S. Rogers, head of the National Security Agency, cleared the way for the inquiry to move forward.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INTEL-01b/05INTEL-01b-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Private Hearing With Intelligence Chiefs Revives House Inquiry on Russia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Closed-Door Hearing With Intelligence Chiefs Resuscitates House Inquiry on Russia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberwarfare and Defense', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Comey, James B', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rogers, Michael S', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schiff, Adam B', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Conaway, K Michael', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-05T01:13:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5131c455-71f2-5edb-b6f7-e1ddd18dd5a0', 'word_count': 810, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5131c455-71f2-5edb-b6f7-e1ddd18dd5a0'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, May 5, 2017.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/04/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-health-care-bill-passed-by-house-faces-senate-test.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, May 5, 2017.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You have every provision of this bill tattooed on your forehead. You will glow in the dark.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Health Care Bill, Passed by House, Faces Senate Test', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2017-05-05T01:15:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89ec8e23-ab6d-5694-81dc-a2fea96db0b7', 'word_count': 42, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89ec8e23-ab6d-5694-81dc-a2fea96db0b7'}, {'abstract': 'The House’s passage of the bill led to an outcry from the health care industry and consumer groups, which found an uncommon ally in some insurers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/04/health/health-care-bill-criticisms.html', 'snippet': 'The House’s passage of the bill led to an outcry from the health care industry and consumer groups, which found an uncommon ally in some insurers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a rare unifying moment. Hospitals, doctors, health insurers and some consumer groups, with few exceptions, are speaking with one voice and urging significant changes to the Republican health care legislation that passed the House on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INSURE/05INSURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INSURE/05INSURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INSURE/05INSURE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/us/05INSURE/05INSURE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1