ight jokes in his first 100 days than any recent president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/05/arts/television/trump-jokes-record-level-on-late-night-tv.html', 'snippet': 'A George Mason University study found that President Trump has been the butt of more late-night jokes in his first 100 days than any recent president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In December, Stephen Colbert told CBS’s John Dickerson in an interview, “Now I have no choice but to actually enjoy this incredible gift every day that Mr. Trump will be,” referring to the oft-repeated notion that President Trump would be a boon to late-night comedy shows.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/05/arts/05colbert/05colbert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit