planned-parenthood-lincoln-center.html', 'snippet': 'Benefits were held last week for the Bronx Children’s Museum, Planned Parenthood, Lincoln Center and Pioneer Works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The spring gala season is in full bloom. Planned Parenthood held its 100th anniversary gala on May 2 at Pier 36. The Bronx Children’s Museum held its inaugural gala on May 2 at Tribeca Rooftop. Lincoln Center held its spring gala on May 2 at Alice Tully Hall. And Pioneer Works held its fourth annual Village Fete on April 30 at its home in Red Hook, Brooklyn.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spring Awakening', 'kicker': 'Party Coverage: Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spring Awakening', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Bronx Children's Museum", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pioneer Works Center for Art and Innovation (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Planned Parenthood Federation of America', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-05T19:28:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denny Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e06dd7e1-60d3-5cd3-89f4-27ff7a455f8d', 'word_count': 67, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e06dd7e1-60d3-5cd3-89f4-27ff7a455f8d'}, {'abstract': 'The area received close to its typical monthly rain total in