saw an uptick in activity and pro- and anti-Trump protesters turned out in modest numbers as the president stopped by his “Camp David North.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/07/nyregion/trump-visit-barely-rustles-the-hedgerows-of-bedminster.html', 'snippet': 'Eateries saw an uptick in activity and pro- and anti-Trump protesters turned out in modest numbers as the president stopped by his “Camp David North.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEDMINSTER, N.J. — The country road rolls through a landscape that resembles a pastoral painting come to life, passing stately houses sitting at the end of winding driveways and horses behind white wooden fences, grazing in unblemished green fields. A little farther down, in an area shrouded by trees, another road sprouts off by a short stone wall with placard that says “Private.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/nyregion/08BEDMINSTER1/08BEDMINSTER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/08/nyregion/08BEDMINSTER1/08BEDMINSTER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/nyregion/08BEDMINSTER1/08BEDMINSTER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/nyregion/08BEDMINSTER1/08BEDMINSTER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/nyregion/08BEDMINSTER1/08BEDMINSTER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid