83c68452-5fff-5b9a-9816-ec8a05270097'}, {'abstract': 'The young political centrist won a strong victory over the extreme rightist Marine Le Pen, but still faces a challenge in governing a divided country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/07/opinion/france-elects-emmanuel-macron.html', 'snippet': 'The young political centrist won a strong victory over the extreme rightist Marine Le Pen, but still faces a challenge in governing a divided country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The decisive election of Emmanuel Macron, a 39-year-old political neophyte committed to the European Union, economic reform and traditional liberalism, as president of France offered powerful relief to everyone who had feared that France could become the next country to succumb to the wave of populism, nationalism and anti-globalism sweeping through Western democracies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/opinion/08mon2web/08mon2web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/08/opinion/08mon2web/08mon2web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/opinion/08mon2web/08mon2web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/opinion/08mon2web/08mon2web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/08/opinion/08mon2web/08mon2web-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp