it at his Alfredo 100 restaurant in New York, has worked with the Roman restaurant to produce an authorized Alfredo sauce for home cooks. It’s made from Parmigiano-Reggiano, butter, extra-virgin olive oil and skim milk, and sold fresh, in 14-ounce containers. But the recipe on the label is somewhat off base. Unless you’re Charlize Theron bulking up for “Monster,” figure a pound of pasta with the whole container of sauce to serve up to eight, not four: The Only Original Alfredo Sauce, $68.28 for four containers, jerseyitaliangravy.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 479, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 479}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10BURNER-ALFREDO/10BURNER-ALFREDO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'cre