78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7305b70-d790-5d51-88fa-8f60533d6af1'}, {'abstract': 'A reporter recounts what happened when a homeless man fell to the tracks at an F train station in New York on a Saturday afternoon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/08/nyregion/help-him-up-a-witnesss-account-of-panic-on-a-subway-platform.html', 'snippet': 'A reporter recounts what happened when a homeless man fell to the tracks at an F train station in New York on a Saturday afternoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man stood bent at the waist, but sideways, as if he were doing some kind of deep stretching. He was incoherent and filthy, his pants around his ankles, but boxer shorts intact. Asleep on his feet with his head buried in his puffy coat, he leaned with an arm outstretched against a metal pillar.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/09/nyregion/09fallen2/09fallen2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/09/nyregion/09fallen2/09fallen2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/09/nyregion/09fallen2/09fallen2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/09/nyregion/09fallen2/09fallen2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/09/nyregion/09fallen2/09fallen2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l