t society. Also, a collection of profiles of those failed by the legal system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/09/nyregion/new-yorks-early-supercop.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the Italian immigrant detective who took on the Black Hand, a deadly secret society. Also, a collection of profiles of those failed by the legal system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Talk about ethnic profiling. Early in the 20th century, the New York City Police Department’s highest-ranking Italian-American officer estimated that perhaps one-fifth of his fellow countrymen in Manhattan were involved in criminal activity. And no one was more determined to reform the image of his fellow immigrants than he.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/07/nyregion/07BOOKSHELF1/07BOOKSHELF1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 712, 'widt