Alexa, please phone home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Using Amazon’s Echo to Phone Home', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-09T17:04:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pui-Wing Tam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pui-wing', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54388d91-f13d-50e6-a0ee-1921a985036b', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54388d91-f13d-50e6-a0ee-1921a985036b'}, {'abstract': 'In his first foreign speech since leaving office, the former president takes up a cause better associated with his wife.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/09/dining/obama-climate-food-milan.html', 'snippet': 'In his first foreign speech since leaving office, the former president takes up a cause better associated with his wife.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — Michelle Obama has long been one of the world’s best-known advocates for healthier food production and better eating, but it was her husband who showed up here on Tuesday to talk about climate change and the challenges it presented to feeding the world’s growing population.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10Milan/09MILAN-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/10/dining/10Milan/09MILAN-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600,