e and Street Life, Often From an Insider’s Perspective', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Don Diva (Magazine)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chiles, Tiffany (1971- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chiles, Kevin D (1964- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-09T21:13:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Feuer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02d05190-9585-5cf7-add4-62c9b1a8b7e9', 'word_count': 1387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02d05190-9585-5cf7-add4-62c9b1a8b7e9'}, {'abstract': 'As opera’s biggest stars shared the spotlight at a gala concert on Sunday, the Met’s follow-spot operators lit them from six stories above the stage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/09/arts/music/one-of-the-toughest-silent-jobs-at-the-met-opera.html', 'snippet': 'As opera’s biggest stars shared the spotlight at a gala concert on Sunday, the Met’s follow-spot operators lit them from six stories above the stage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From his aerie in the gilded ceiling of the vast Metropolitan Opera House, just behind the Sputnik chandeliers and some six stories above the stage, Tim Guscott fixed Anna Netrebko in his sights. Then he cast a beam of light so narrow and precisely aimed that it illuminated only that Russian diva’s head as she sang Puccini far below.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'sub