ain': 'Charlie Hunnam: Pushy When It Counts (Picky, Too)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pushy When It Counts (Picky, Too)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hunnam, Charlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'King Arthur (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ritchie, Guy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Lost City of Z (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gray, James (1969- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-10T09:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec22d581-0f53-5f90-b4de-2f0ee2635228', 'word_count': 1665, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec22d581-0f53-5f90-b4de-2f0ee2635228'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Platt wrecks himself onstage in “Dear Evan Hansen.” Surviving it takes practice — and has made him a favorite to win a Tony Award.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/10/theater/how-ben-platt-beame-the-toast-of-broadway-dear-evan-hansen-tony-awards.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Platt wrecks himself onstage in “Dear Evan Hansen.” Surviving it takes practice — and has made him a favorite to win a Tony Award.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I recently followed Ben Platt up to his dressing room after a Sunday matinee of the Broadway musical “Dear Evan Hansen.” He looked worn out. His eyes were puffy and red. He sat shirtless in front of his mirror, against which leaned a framed photograph of Judy Garland, and removed his makeup. He’d lost 30 pounds to more convincingly play the part of an anxiety-crippled 17-year-old (he’s 23), and it was a little startling to see up close how lean he was. There were four perfectly round bruises on his back from his regular cupping sessions, among the therapies he employs to keep himself healthy enough to go onstage eight times a week and perform a role that ranks with Hedwig and Jean Valjean in its physical and emotional demands.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 887, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 887}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/arts/14BENPLATT/14BENPLATT-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1386, 'subTyp