/5682c545-3aeb-52d4-a44e-3fbc1bbf2b1b'}, {'abstract': 'Chances are she already has the stuff she needs. On this holiday, give a gift that says you get her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/10/fashion/mothers-day-gifts-that-are-actually-cool.html', 'snippet': 'Chances are she already has the stuff she needs. On this holiday, give a gift that says you get her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As all of us good children are aware, Sunday is Mother’s Day. Phone calls, flowers and thoughtfully worded cards are certainly in order, but to go the extra mile, a gift is the ticket. Sentiment is important, to be sure, but only insofar as it is attached to an object worthy of the receiver. A cool mom will appreciate stylish gifts that don’t underestimate her own good taste. Here, a selection of items that are sure to impress.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/fashion/11BROWSE4/11BROWSE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 985, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/11/fashion/11BROWSE4/11BROWSE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 985}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/fashion/11BROWSE4/11BROWSE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 624, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/fashion/11BROWSE4/11BROWSE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1247, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/fashion/11BROWSE4/11BROWSE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im