yt://article/dd19a33a-3799-542f-9beb-51773145254f'}, {'abstract': 'There was sightseeing, but the real focus of a trip organized by Altruvistas was to educate travelers about exploitation — and how to combat it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/11/travel/thailand-vacation-fighting-trafficking-exploitation-altruvistas.html', 'snippet': 'There was sightseeing, but the real focus of a trip organized by Altruvistas was to educate travelers about exploitation — and how to combat it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We sat around a long wooden table that took up most of a thatched-roof bungalow nestled in the hills of Chiang Rai province in Thailand. Barefoot, a dog curled at my feet, I stared at a large computer screen, engrossed in P’moo’s video presentation. She spoke passionately, gesticulating with her hands, then waited as our guide translated her words into English. While she talked, I recognized one she used repeatedly: trafficking.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/travel/14THAILAND-SUB/14THAILAND-SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/14/travel/14THAILAND-SUB/14THAILAND-SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/travel/14THAILAND-SUB/14THAILAND-SUB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/14/travel/14THAILAND-SUB/14THAILAND-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/14/travel/14THAILA