'uri': 'nyt://article/0fec3476-dee6-5fcb-822a-1b872cbbbf82'}, {'abstract': 'Visitors to my suicide prevention website have said I can’t possibly understand their experience. They assume I have never been suicidal myself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/11/well/mind/a-suicide-therapists-secret-past.html', 'snippet': 'Visitors to my suicide prevention website have said I can’t possibly understand their experience. They assume I have never been suicidal myself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My friends called it a boxcar, the tiny cream-colored duplex I rented in Austin 20 years ago, a long rectangle divided by doorways without doors. The oak floors were so old that the finish had long ago worn away. They were filthy. I mopped, but dirt stubbornly remained caked between the slats of wood.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/15/science/well-suicide-revise/well-suicide-revise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/15/science/well-suicide-revise/well-suicide-revise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/15/science/well-suicide-revise/well-suicide-revise-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/15/science/well-suicide-revise/well-suicide-revise-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/15/science/well-suicide-revise/well-suicide-revise-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 462}}, {'rank': 0,