4c-cf9c-59a2-98fa-d99014a68a0d'}, {'abstract': 'Book clubs can be the epicenter of fierce friendships and enmity; a breeding ground for resentments large and small.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/11/books/dear-book-club-its-you-not-me.html', 'snippet': 'Book clubs can be the epicenter of fierce friendships and enmity; a breeding ground for resentments large and small.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Goldspiel is an inspired educator and a most cheerful fellow, a golden retriever among men. The assistant superintendent of schools in Roslyn, N.Y., he was describing plans for his new book club. It was going to be great, he told me. Not like his last club. His last club, forget it: “If I can’t make the occasional joke about the text or myself, I’m not interested.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 1159, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1159}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 531, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/12/arts/12BOOKS1/12BOOKS1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1400, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dear Book Club: It’s You, Not Me', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dear Book Club: It’s You, Not Me', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Clubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-11T19:23:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9e28776-8f8d-5cfc-9d85-fe3e2b33715e', 'word_count': 1434, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9e28776-8f8d-5cfc-9d85-fe3e2b33715e'}, {'abstract': 'From her old apartment on 16th Street to some of her most prized possessions, the designer brings T into her world — with 18 photographs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2017/05/11/t-magazine/profile-in-style-anna-sui.html', 'snippet': 'From her old apartment on 16th Street to some of her most prized possessions, the designer brings T into her world — with 18 photographs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From her old apartment on 16th Street to some of her most prized possessions, the designer brings T into her world — with 18 photographs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/t-magazine/anna-sui-slide-RVGW/anna-sui-slide-RVGW-t