f_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/4bfb87da-935a-5b20-92c2-45693067dbf8', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/4bfb87da-935a-5b20-92c2-45693067dbf8'}, {'abstract': 'The free-spirited fashion designer shares her inspirations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/11/t-magazine/fashion/anna-sui-profile-style.html', 'snippet': 'The free-spirited fashion designer shares her inspirations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anna Sui isn’t a fashion designer who does things by half-measures. Her trippy, psychedelia-inspired world, which fuses fashion with the music-saturated culture of the ’60s, has been unfurling on New York’s runways since her first wildly colorful show in 1991 — staged with the encouragement of her friends, photographer Steven Meisel and supermodels Naomi Campbell, Linda Evangelista and Christy Turlington. Sui’s free-spirited clothes still serve as a riposte to anyone who claims American fashion is fixated on cold, clean minimalism.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '50', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/t-magazine/anna-sui-promo/anna-sui-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/11/t-magazine/anna-sui-promo/anna-sui-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/t-magazine/anna-sui-promo/anna-sui-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/11/t-magazine/anna-sui-promo/anna-sui-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1031, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum