abstract': 'Paul Kahan, Alon Shaya and Jessica Koslow are among the chefs who will cook dinners during two-week residences at the Seaport Food Lab.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/15/dining/south-street-seaport-district-nyc-guest-chefs-dinner.html', 'snippet': 'Paul Kahan, Alon Shaya and Jessica Koslow are among the chefs who will cook dinners during two-week residences at the Seaport Food Lab.', 'lead_paragraph': 'South Street Seaport has been rebranded as Seaport District N.Y.C., and its new Seaport Food Lab will feature guest chefs from June 19 through Oct. 14. Paul Kahan, Cosmo Goss and Erling Wu-Bower from Chicago, Hugh Acheson from Georgia, Alon Shaya from New Orleans, Jessica Koslow from Los Angeles, and the local talent Dale Talde will cook dinners during two-week residences. In addition, the pub Clinton Hall opens Wednesday. The outdoor Garden Bar and the Front Row Food Market, a group of food trucks, start May 24, and a cocktail lounge called Mr. Cannon Speakeasy opens June 19. Eventually, the area will get a David Chang restaurant and one from Jean-Georges Vongerichten, who will also open a market: Seaport Food Lab, 203 Front Street (Beekman Street), tickets $75, Seaport District N.Y.C., 19 Fulton Street (South Street), seaportdistrict.nyc.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/dining/17BURNER-LAB/17BURNER-LAB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/17/dining/17BURNER-LAB/17BURNER-LAB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/dining/17BURNER-LAB/17BURNER-LAB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thum