dent’s new commission is based on a myth, and is crafted to cover up for his own lies about the election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/15/opinion/trump-voter-fraud-commission.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s new commission is based on a myth, and is crafted to cover up for his own lies about the election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump’s repeated claim  that “millions” of noncitizens voted illegally in the 2016 election has always been transparently self-serving — a desperate attempt to soothe his damaged ego and explain how he could have lost the popular vote to Hillary Clinton by almost three million votes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 701}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 877, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1198, 'width': 1026, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/16/opinion/16tue1/16tue1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None