: 'nyt://interactive/832e7ea3-7c3d-5245-bd42-766c24f73257'}, {'abstract': 'A star of “Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt” talks about growing up in Georgia and taking a firm stance with his mother as an adult.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/16/arts/television/tituss-burgess-the-first-time-i-had-to-parent-my-mom.html', 'snippet': 'A star of “Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt” talks about growing up in Georgia and taking a firm stance with his mother as an adult.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My mother was a single parent for much of my youth. She worked during the day, and so when I was about 5 to 12 years old I would spend the summer at my grandparents’ home in Georgia, with my mom bringing me back to Athens on the weekends. In my early years, I protested. You see, their home was large. I truly thought something would come and steal me in the night and that no one would hear my cry for help. The house sat on a farm off Highway 78, surrounded by trees and animals. Oh, the noises I would hear! If a small branch so much as dropped on the tin roof, I knew that was the end for me. But I learned to love being there as I got older and realized how special this time was with my grandparents.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21FIRST-TITUS/21FIRST-TITUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 271, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21FIRST-TITUS/21FIRST-TITUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 271}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21FIRST-TITUS/21FIRST-TITUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images