 overthink things, by Paul Hunsberger.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/16/crosswords/the-danger-of-overthinking-things.html', 'snippet': 'An example of why it’s sometimes bad to overthink things, by Paul Hunsberger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEDNESDAY PUZZLE — When you’ve solved enough crossword puzzles, you begin to realize that you’ve been trained to think a certain way, and when Will Shortz and a constructor decide to change things up a bit, it can take you (and by that I mean me) by surprise.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/17/crosswords/17wordplay-oslo/17wordplay-oslo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/17/cr