President Trump has defended sharing intelligence with the Russians, but he hasn’t always been consistent in his assessment of leaks of classified information.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/17/us/politics/fact-check-trump-leaks.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump has defended sharing intelligence with the Russians, but he hasn’t always been consistent in his assessment of leaks of classified information.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump has said he has an “absolute right” to reveal highly classified information to Russian officials and defended his disclosure as a way to collaborate against terrorism, contradicting earlier positions on leaks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/18/us/18factcheck/18factcheck-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 