'firstname': 'Jeannie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Choi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cdd5c61-29d7-52f4-a996-e849ba72e400', 'word_count': 2130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cdd5c61-29d7-52f4-a996-e849ba72e400'}, {'abstract': 'New science fiction and fantasy includes ghosts and warring gods, a desert apocalypse, a cloned messiah and the quest for light-speed travel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/18/books/review/the-latest-in-science-fiction-and-fantasy.html', 'snippet': 'New science fiction and fantasy includes ghosts and warring gods, a desert apocalypse, a cloned messiah and the quest for light-speed travel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the rough-and-tumble Weird West of Maurice Broaddus’s BUFFALO SOLDIER (Tom Doherty, paper, $14.99), an ex-spy battles hunters determined to capture the terrifying weapon he’s stolen. It’s an exciting, if familiar, plot — but Broaddus shows little interest in predictable adventure narratives. Instead he packs this slim novella with alternate American history, fantastic technology and father-son bonding, for a far more surprising and satisfying result.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 1148, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1148}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 536, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1546, 'width': 808, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/books/review/0521-BKS-Otherworldly/0521-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ghosts, Warring Gods and the Apocalypse: The Best of New Science Fiction and Fantasy', 'kicker': 'Otherworldly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Science Fiction and Fantasy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Buffalo Soldier (Book)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Broaddus, Maurice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Proof of Concept (Book)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Gwyneth (1952- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Lotus Blue (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sparks, Cat (1965- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Food of the Gods (Book)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '