 'nyt://article/235c7261-c41a-5c0e-8104-b2fd295fe4e4'}, {'abstract': 'The cartoonist has written the book, while the producer Jeffrey Seller is directing the show’s premiere.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/18/theater/jules-feiffer-and-a-hamilton-producer-color-outside-the-lines-for-a-new-musical.html', 'snippet': 'The cartoonist has written the book, while the producer Jeffrey Seller is directing the show’s premiere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jules Feiffer sat on the sidelines quietly watching as actors sang, danced and manipulated puppets representing superhero characters that he had drawn. Then he leaned slightly left toward Jeffrey Seller, the director of “The Man in the Ceiling,” a new musical for which Mr. Feiffer wrote the book — a first for this 88-year-old cartoonist and author.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21CEILING1/21CEILING1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21CEILING1/21CEILING1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21CEILING1/21CEILING1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21CEILING1/21CEILING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/arts/21CEILING1/21CEILING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21