asketball players at the free throw line.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/18/nyregion/free-throw-shooting-robot.html', 'snippet': 'A new exhibit at the National Museum of Mathematics attempts to solve the vexing problem facing basketball players at the free throw line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the first round of the N.B.A. playoffs this spring, the Houston Rockets faced the Oklahoma City Thunder, and Andre Roberson, a forward for the Thunder, was having a rough time making baskets. In one game, he went an embarrassing 2 for 12 from the free throw line. The Rockets closed out the game by fouling him on purpose, and the players on the Rockets bench were laughing at him openly.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/nyregion/21WIP2/21WIP2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 