should stand, where the cameras will be” and even whether to hold the phone “with my right hand or my left hand.” Now, Haldeman reported in a memo, “I think Ailes is probably the best man for the job.” He was hired, as a consultant, at $100 a day (about $650 today).', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/opinion/19greenbergWeb/19greenbergWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Roger Ailes Learned From Richard Nixon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ailes, Fox and the Silent Demographic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Richard Milhous', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AILES, ROGER E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-19T01:21:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Greenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Greenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/8600b5ab-4fbf-5cbf-ab07-84be250049cb', 'word_count': 842, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8600b5ab-4fbf-5cbf-ab07-84be250049cb'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Ailes was ousted barely two weeks after the former Fox News anchor Gretchen Carlson filed a lawsuit accusing him of sexual harassment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/18/business/media/roger-ailes-fox-news-sexual-harassment-.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Ailes was ousted barely two weeks after the former Fox News anchor Gretchen Carlson filed a lawsuit accusing him of sexual harassment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent months, Roger E. Ailes’s influence seemed to be everywhere in the news.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/19/business/19TUMULT/19TUMULT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/19/business/19TUMULT/19TUMULT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption