2017/05/19/us/politics/community-development-block-grant-program.html', 'snippet': 'The Community Development Block Grant has been criticized as inefficient. We explored the impact the program has had on American families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Lucia Rodriguez, misplaced car keys mean more than an unexpected cab ride or a missed party. Without her car, Ms. Rodriguez, her husband and their three children cannot make the weekly trip from their Nueces County, Tex., home and a well with a history of arsenic problems to a store to buy bottled water to drink. So for two agonizing days in February, the family carefully rationed one remaining gallon of bottled water as Ms. Rodriguez, 29, searched frantically for her keys.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community-02/20community-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community-02/20community-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community-02/20community-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community-02/20community-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community-02/20community-02-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/20/us/20community