09c472e5f'}, {'abstract': 'The ex-congressman, whose wife, Huma Abedin, was a top aide to Hillary Clinton, admitted to sending sexually explicit images to a girl he knew was 15.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/19/nyregion/anthony-weiner-guilty-plea-sexting.html', 'snippet': 'The ex-congressman, whose wife, Huma Abedin, was a top aide to Hillary Clinton, admitted to sending sexually explicit images to a girl he knew was 15.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anthony D. Weiner, the former Democratic congressman whose sexting scandals ended his political career and embroiled him in a tumultuous F.B.I. investigation of Hillary Clinton before the election, pleaded guilty to a felony on Friday, crying openly as he admitted to conduct that he knew was “as morally wrong as it was unlawful.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/nyregion/20PLEA2/20PLEA2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/20/nyregion/20PLEA2/20PLEA2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/nyregion/20PLEA2/20PLEA2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/nyregion/20PLEA2/20PLEA2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/nyregion/20PLEA2/20PLEA2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20