 external hard drive, via my Mac. It seemed as if everything had been transferred, so I deleted the content from the cards so I could reuse them. However, when I plugged my external hard drive in to look at the photos, the pictures weren’t there and I still haven’t found them! Any ideas as to how to get them back?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Uncovering Missing or Deleted Photos', 'kicker': 'Tech Tip', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-19T15:43:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. D. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/c98c4629-b068-55ba-85b3-96e98213cb6b', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c98c4629-b068-55ba-85b3-96e98213cb6b'}, {'abstract': 'Stanley Greene, a founding member of Noor Images who covered global conflicts with unblinking honesty, has died in Paris.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2017/05/19/blogs/stanley-greene-teller-of-uncomfortable-truths-dies-at-68.html', 'snippet': 'Stanley Greene, a founding member of Noor Images who covered global conflicts with unblinking honesty, has died in Paris.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stanley Greene, a founding member of Noor Images who covered global conflicts with unblinking honesty, has died in Paris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type