r Quartet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/19/arts/music/listen-to-a-twin-peaks-fantasy-for-string-quartet.html', 'snippet': 'Daniel Schlosberg, who wrote his thesis on Angelo Badalementi’s indelible score for the David Lynch show, has written a piece based on it for the Dover Quartet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Diane, it’s 9:07 a.m., I’ve just listened to some music inspired by Angelo Badalamenti’s score for “Twin Peaks,” played by a string quartet. The Dover Quartet. The piece, “Twin Peaks Fantasy,” is a work in progress by the composer Daniel Schlosberg. Gather the others at the Bureau, get that morning cup of coffee, and listen here:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/20/arts/20peaksquartert/20peaksquartert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0