rges. But because they were not engaging in sex, they were not charged with homosexuality, which is a crime in Bangladesh.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/19/world/asia/bangladesh-gay-men-arrested.html', 'snippet': 'Twenty-seven men were arrested on drug charges. But because they were not engaging in sex, they were not charged with homosexuality, which is a crime in Bangladesh.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — The police in Bangladesh raided a monthly gathering of gay men at a community center on the outskirts of Dhaka early Friday and arrested 27 men on suspicion of drug-related offenses, officials said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bangladesh Police Raid Gay Men’s Gathering', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangladesh', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-19T19:23:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hari Kumar and Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e2987e3-19da-5cfe-921f-15cb1563e132', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e2987e3-19da-5cfe-921f-15cb1563e132'}, {'abstract': 'A new building is designed with a full-service lounge open to anyone, instead of a staid front lobby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/19/realestate/a-rental-building-with-a-hip-hotel-bar-vibe.html', 'snippet': 'A new building is designed with a full-service lounge open to anyone, instead of a staid front lobby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few years ago, Eric Birnbaum, a partner at Imperial Companies, was enjoying a drink at the buzzing lobby bar of the Bowery Hotel when he was struck by a question: Why couldn’t the lobby of a residential building have just as much energy as a happening boutique hotel?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/realestate/0521HIGHEND1/0521HIGHEND1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'w