contender-surge-back.html', 'snippet': 'The Rangers, who have reached the postseason five times this decade, have recovered from a slow start thanks to a nine-game winning streak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Texas Rangers played host last week to the Philadelphia Phillies, a matchup that recalled one of the boldest, franchise-defining moves in recent years. Two summers ago, with his team well under .500 and coming off a 95-loss season, Rangers General Manager Jon Daniels traded five top prospects in an eight-player deal that brought starting pitcher Cole Hamels to Texas.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/21/sports/21KEPNER1/21KEPNERweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 