 not see the two-hour premiere until Sunday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/22/watching/twin-peaks-review-roundup-season-3.html', 'snippet': 'Many critics and reviewers did not see the two-hour premiere until Sunday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the weeks leading up to Showtime’s anxiously awaited “Twin Peaks: The Return,” critics seized the opportunity to spend time with David Lynch’s original series, recapping and reappraising and recounting the behind-the-scenes story of the game-changing mystery that premiered on ABC in 1990. The one thing they couldn’t do was review the new series — because, in true Lynchian fashion, no advance screeners were distributed to the media. (On Friday, there was an embargoed premiere screening in Los Angeles.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/22/watching/22twin-peaks-chatter/22twin-peaks-chatter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/22/watching/22twin-peaks-chatter/22twin-peaks-chatter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/22/watching/22twin-peaks-chatter/22twin-peaks-chatter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/22/watching/22twin-peaks-chatter/22twin-peaks-chatter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/22/watching/22twin-peaks-chatter/22twin-peaks-chatter-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thu