erful engine for spreading information. It has also spread online harassment and fake news and fed other toxic digital behavior.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Cleaning Up the Internet', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberharassment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Evan C', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-22T16:46:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pui-Wing Tam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pui-wing', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b38e97c1-0391-581a-a85d-7165fb75442e', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b38e97c1-0391-581a-a85d-7165fb75442e'}, {'abstract': 'The singer’s self-titled album debuted at the top of the Billboard chart. The Zac Brown Band followed at No. 2, and Logic dropped 10 spots to No. 11.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/22/arts/music/harry-styles-solo-album-billboard-chart.html', 'snippet': 'The singer’s self-titled album debuted at the top of the Billboard chart. The Zac Brown Band followed at No. 2, and Logic dropped 10 spots to No. 11.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During its reign as the pre-eminent boy band of the 2010s, One Direction scored four No. 1 albums. Now two of its former members have also reached the top.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/23/arts/23BILLBOARD/23BILLBOARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 6