'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ed87bcd-6258-5775-a261-c7c327a83127', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ed87bcd-6258-5775-a261-c7c327a83127'}, {'abstract': 'While attention is elsewhere, Senate leaders are laying the groundwork to take health insurance from millions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/23/opinion/health-care-bill-senate.html', 'snippet': 'While attention is elsewhere, Senate leaders are laying the groundwork to take health insurance from millions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While the rest of the country has been transfixed by Trumpian chaos, members of the Senate have spent the last two weeks talking about taking health insurance from millions of Americans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtWeb/23leonhardtWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtWeb/23leonhardtWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtWeb/23leonhardtWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtWeb/23leonhardtWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtWeb/23leonhardtWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/23/opinion/23leonhardtW