tive.blogs.nytimes.com/2017/05/23/1917-mexico-faces-ruin-as-strikes-spread/', 'snippet': 'A wave of civil unrest in Mexico was reported to be instigated by German agents. The United States feared the unrest might spread, and sent gunboats to persuade the Mexican authorities to keep order.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW YORK — The New York Herald this morning prints an unusual despatch from its special correspondent “somewhere in Mexico,” and although, in accordance with the request of the United States Government, all matters appertaining to Mexico’s international relations are eliminated, the correspondent reports that numerous strikes are paralyzing all commercial and industrial activity in Mexico. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1917: Mexico Faces Ruin as Strikes Spread', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-23T13:25:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/871f7bec-4b76-50a4-80de-32c813c5f10e', 'word_count': 304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/871f7bec-4b76-50a4-80de-32c813c5f10e'}, {'abstract': 'The commencement speaker Yang Shuping, a senior at the University of Maryland, was accused on social media of selling out her homeland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/23/world/asia/chinese-student-fresh-air-yang-shuping.html', 'snippet': 'The commencement speaker Yang Shuping, a senior at the University of Maryland, was accused on social media of selling out her homeland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Speaking at the University of Maryland, Yang Shuping, a graduating senior from China, sprinkled her upbeat commencement speech with observations that drew warm applause: The air was far cleaner in the United States than in China, she said, and she could openly discuss racism, sexism and politics in ways that she had never before dreamed possible.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 1939, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/24/world/24MARYLAND-1/24MARYLAND-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh