: 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2017/05/24/australias-aboriginal-stolen-generation-tells-its-stories/', 'snippet': 'In “Generations Stolen,” Matthew Sherwood documents the fates of mixed-race aboriginal children who had been kidnapped from their families during Australia’s disastrous experiment with forced assimilation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alfred Calma was 4 years old when the police snatched him from his mother, never to live with her again. Joyce Napurrula-Schroeder was not quite 2 when it happened to her. Luke Morcom was a newborn, barely a week on this earth. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Australia’s ‘Stolen Generations’ Tell Their Stories', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORIGINES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping and Hostages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherwood, Matthew (Photographer)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-05-24T08:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Evelyn Nieves', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Evelyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nieves', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organi