ing her cigarettes and saying, “I’m going to tell the children what it was really like to fight Mr. DeMille.” I’m in my mid-30s! So I am still close to the experiences, but they’re far enough away for me to reflect on and to find lessons.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '62', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1282, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1282}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 959, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Janet Mock Struggles With Being Called a ‘Trans Advocate’', 'kicker': 'Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Janet Mock Wants You to Learn From Her Experience', 'name': None, 'seo