6-bb3a-e66e847547cb'}, {'abstract': 'We’ve learned a lot about nostalgia, what triggers it and how it works. (Caution for readers of a certain age: sentimental songs and videos ahead.)', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/25/smarter-living/nostalgia-memories.html', 'snippet': 'We’ve learned a lot about nostalgia, what triggers it and how it works. (Caution for readers of a certain age: sentimental songs and videos ahead.)', 'lead_paragraph': 'Around this time of year, every year for the last 10 or so, I have indulged in a strange but comforting ritual. I see the Facebook photos of tassels turning, I get the feels — lots of them — and then I plunge into the depths of my music library to rediscover Vitamin C’s “Graduation.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp-nostalgia2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp-nostalgia2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp-nostalgia2-jumbo-v6.gif', 'height': 427, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp-nostalgia2-superJumbo-v6.gif', 'height': 427, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp-nostalgia2-thumbStandard-v4.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/26/us/26xp-nostalgia2/26xp