ore junior levels. In the course of managing my own career, I have sometimes found myself interviewing someone whom I want to add to my team — even as I am in the process of interviewing for another position and potentially leaving the company. Worse, there have been a couple of occasions when I have  hired someone, only to resign shortly afterward. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/business/28workologist1/21workologist-illo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1091, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop