uded on the New York Public Library’s list of best New York City books by neighborhood. Mr. Joyce, a Staten Island native and Brooklyn transplant, will join us for the conversation, along with Amy Ryan, the Academy Award-nominated actress and friend of the author’s, who frequently portrays the kinds of characters Mr. Joyce has created in “Small Mercies.” The live discussion will take place online on Tuesday from 6:30 to 8:30 p.m.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/30/nyregion/30BOOKCLUB1/30BOOKCLUB1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/04/30/nyregion/30BOOKCLUB1/30BOOKCLUB1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/30/nyregion/30BOOKCLUB1/30BOOKCLUB1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/30/nyregion/30BOOKCLUB1/30BOOKCLUB1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 333, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/30/nyregion/30BOOKCLUB1/30BOOKCLUB1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 333, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Big City Book Club: Eddie Joyce’s ‘Small Mercies’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big City Book Club', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value