opping out with startling resonance in a series of recent performances, our critic writes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/26/arts/music/trump-has-changed-a-night-at-the-opera-too.html', 'snippet': 'Political strands within familiar works have been popping out with startling resonance in a series of recent performances, our critic writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was two days before the inauguration of Donald J. Trump, and I had never been so eager to be heading to a production of Rossini’s “The Barber of Seville.” The contentious election and its stunning result had left Americans bitterly divided. Spending a few hours in the comfort of the Metropolitan Opera enjoying the madcap adventures of Rossini’s endearing characters would surely provide a welcome escape.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/arts/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/28/arts/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/arts/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/arts/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/arts/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1/28TRUMPCLASSICAL1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,