 TBS, has not always had a high-flying comedy career. “If you can name any job, I’ve had it,” said Ms. Miller, 50, who had worked in academia, construction and food service, among other fields, before she was hired to write for “The Daily Show,” where she met Ms. Bee and the co-executive producer for “Full Frontal,” Alison Camillo. “We are like the three perimenopausal musketeers,” she said. During the week, Ms. Miller lives with her cat, Sammy, in Harlem, but on Friday nights, they drive to her 650-square-foot house in the Catskills. Sammy loves it, she said. “He thinks he’s king of the jungle up there.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/nyregion/28ROUTINE2/28ROUTINE2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'sup