nce and immaculate new-wave hooks — many of which will get the arena-scale grandeur they cry out for on Thursday night at the band’s first-ever headline gig at the Garden. SIMON VOZICK-LEVINSON', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/26/arts/26LISTINGSPOP/26LISTINGSPOP-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '10 Things to Do in NYC Now', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank'