at is not likely to go away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/26/world/canada/kellie-leitch-canada-immigration-conservatives.html', 'snippet': 'Kellie Leitch, a candidate for leadership of Canada’s Conservative Party, has set off a debate that is not likely to go away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To Kellie Leitch, one of more than a dozen candidates vying to lead Canada’s Conservative Party, the most pressing issue today is something that some of her critics consider un-Canadian: the need to preserve what she calls “Canadian values” through a more restrictive immigration policy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/11/world/12Tories2/12Tories2