em is nowhere near the best and is getting worse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/05/26/opinion/cuomo-subways-new-york.html', 'snippet': '“We need to have the best transit system on the globe,” Gov. Andrew Cuomo said this week, but New York’s system is nowhere near the best and is getting worse.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We need to have the best transit system on the globe,” Gov. Andrew Cuomo said earlier this week about the Metropolitan Transportation Authority. New Yorkers couldn’t agree more. They also know the system is nowhere near the best and is getting worse. They’re impatient for Mr. Cuomo, who is ultimately responsible for the system, to deliver on his latest promise to turn things around.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 722}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/27/opinion/27sat2/27sat2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 852, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'l