welfare-state-shouldnt-be-the-enemy.html', 'snippet': 'A free-market welfare state may seem like an oxymoron, but it’s the future of the Republican Party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even Republicans hotly critical of Donald Trump’s brand of populist nationalism were a little giddy with excitement when he won the presidency with healthy Republican majorities in both houses of Congress.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/28/sunday-review/28wilkinson/28wilkinson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1204, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_nam