ock \'n\' roll" — and that\'s not just their look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s something universal about Alessandro Michele’s vision of fashion. That’s not to say it’s universally appealing — but rather that Michele’s got his eyes on something bigger than just clothes. At Gucci, the designer crafts an entire creative cosmos, where each facet\xa0— from designing new packaging featuring wild beasts and exotic flowers, to redecorating over 500 stores with plush tufted velvet panels and delicately turned bijouterie cases — flawlessly segues into a very particular vision of fashion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU/Gucci-cruise-slide-E0DU-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/05/30/t-magazine/fashion/Gucci-cruis