ous wedding celebrations. As it turns out, finding the perfect summer wedding ensemble is a bit like the search for the perfect mate: There are a lot of options on the market, but it can be frustratingly difficult to find the one that suits your particular wants and needs. If you’re likely to spend the night on the dance floor, comfortable shoes are a priority; if you’re headed to an outdoor ceremony, a cool, breathable outfit is a must. There’s the dress code, the weather — not to mention the pack of people one hopes to make envious (without upstaging the bride, of course). Here, some ideas to make the search a little easier. As for finding the perfect date, you’re on your own.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/06/01/fashion/01BROWSE1-PANTS/01BROWSE1-PANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th